-astoria\" title=\"Yelp\" aria-label=\"Ambrosia Garden on Yelp\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"fab fa-yelp\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/3q9yoH9kgFF5f4LSA\" title=\"Google Maps\" aria-label=\"Ambrosia Garden on Google Maps\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"fas fa-map-marker-alt\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.instagram.com/ambrosia.garden.nyc\" title=\"Website\" aria-label=\"Ambrosia Garden website\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"fas fa-arrow-up-right-from-square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n","id":"/nyc/mediterranean/ambrosia-garden/"},{"html":"\u003cdiv class=\"card\" data-review=\"/nyc/mediterranean/stamatis/\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"thumb\"\u003e\n            \u003cimg src=\"https://pics.gourmandsyndrome.com/stamatis%2F0_front-640x480.webp\" alt=\"Stamatis\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"body\"\u003e\n        \u003ca class=\"title\" href=\"https://www.gourmandsyndrome.com/nyc/mediterranean/stamatis/\"\u003eStamatis\u003c/a\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"loc\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.gourmandsyndrome.com/nyc/neighborhood/astoria/\"\u003e\n\n\nAstoria\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href=\"https://www.gourmandsyndrome.com/nyc/borough/queens/\"\u003eQueens\u003c/a\u003e · \u003ca href=\"/nyc/\"\u003eNew York City\u003c/a\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"cuisine-chips\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.gourmandsyndrome.com/nyc/cuisine/greek/\"\u003eGreek\u003c/a\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.gourmandsyndrome.com/nyc/cuisine/mediterranean/\"\u003eMediterranean\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"excerpt\"\u003eIn our conquest to try more Greek restaurants in the Astoria area since we’re moving further away from the region, I saw Stamatis was on people’s list as a place you have to go to.\u003c/div\u003e\n   